@startuml
title State Diagram for Plane Lifecycle

[*] --> Order
state Order
state Arrival
state Preparation
state Operations
state Maintenance
state OutOfService
state Removed

Order --> Arrival : plane arrives
Arrival --> Preparation : plane prepared
Preparation --> (Operations or Maintenance) : condition and schedule check
Operations --> Maintenance : no more scheduled flights or maintenance required
Maintenance --> Preparation : checked and serviced
OutOfService --> Removed : permanently withdrawn from service

@enduml
